vorites of fate or cursed to perish at the hands of the hero? The choice is yours alone. And remember, the higher the risk, the greater the reward.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453560/extras/new1.PNG?t=1687487228\" /></span><br><br></li><li> Abilities and weapons are not tied to a class. Create an assassin with a fireball, a knight with a staff, or a warlock healer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453560/extras/new2.PNG?t=1687487228\" /></span><br><br></li><li> Play along and become an epic hero who fights for justice or break the stereotypes and embrace chaos.<br><br></li><li> Two romance interest. Choose between pragmatic ice princess and mischievous demon queen\u2026 or maybe you are the greedy one?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453560/extras/pr1.PNG?t=1687487228\" /></span></li></ul>",
